---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Heading1, Heading2, Paragraph, PreformattedText } from '@entur/typography';
---

<BaseLayout title="Getting started" description="Install and use Entur AI as a Claude Code marketplace.">
  <Heading1>Getting started</Heading1>
  <Paragraph>
    Entur AI is a Claude Code plugin marketplace. Install via the marketplace command, then enable individual plugins.
  </Paragraph>

  <Heading2>Add the marketplace</Heading2>
  <PreformattedText>
{`/plugin marketplace add entur/ai`}
  </PreformattedText>

  <Heading2>Install a plugin</Heading2>
  <PreformattedText>
{`/plugin install bootstrap@entur
/plugin install scr@entur
/plugin install cicd-workflows@entur`}
  </PreformattedText>

  <Heading2>Use a skill</Heading2>
  <Paragraph>
    Skills auto-trigger from natural language. Bootstrap a new app: ask the agent to "scaffold a new Entur service".
    See the <a href="./skills">Skills</a> index for all available skills.
  </Paragraph>
</BaseLayout>
